 fail={'d1':'An AZ is lost → objects still readable from the remaining 8 of 12 fragments; repair rebuilds missing fragments elsewhere.','meta':'Metadata shard leader fails → Raft elects a new leader in seconds; writes to that shard pause briefly.','place':'Placement service down → cached ring on front-ends keeps working.','repair':'Scrubber behind → durability margin shrinks; alert on "fragments at risk".'},
 deep=['Metadata vs data separation; metadata in a strongly consistent sharded KV (commit the metadata row last = atomic PUT).','Erasure coding (Reed-Solomon k+m) vs replication: storage cost vs repair bandwidth and small-object overhead.','Placement with consistent hashing + failure domains (component), rebalancing moves ~1/N.','Background scrubbing with checksums; lifecycle tiering to cold storage.'],
