 capacity=['10k charges/s peak; idempotency records ≈ 1 KB × 24 h retention ≈ 860 GB → sharded KV with TTL.','Ledger entries: 2–4 rows per charge → 40k rows/s into an append-only, partitioned store.','Card network calls take 100 ms–2 s → async state machine, not a blocking request.'],
