 fail={'psp':'Bank times out → charge stays "pending"; reconcile later by querying the bank with our reference; never re-send blindly.','idem':'Idempotency store down → reject POSTs with 503 (fail closed) — accepting them risks duplicates.','hook':'Merchant endpoint down → exponential backoff for up to 3 days, then dead-letter queue + dashboard.','ledger':'Ledger write fails → the state machine retries; entries are keyed by charge id so a retry cannot double-post.'},
